휴대폰에서 칸이 flex 알약이 되며 값 span이 블록이 되자 css/60-motion.css의 .cv(content-visibility auto,
contain-intrinsic-size 900px)가 적용됐다. 공개 사이트 /food/·/places/가 390px 휴대폰에서 'load'까지 970px로
놓여 축소돼 보였다(2026-11-06 실측). 칸 값에는 content-visibility: visible — 대구각 fd3e658e4와 같은 고침,
첫 프레임 폭 시험 추가(고치기 전 실패 확인).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Vhf1SypptEkAFVTS6m3chR
---
 templates/assets/css/30-info.css |  5 +++++
 tests/test_list_conditions.py    | 13 +++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 18 insertions(+)

diff --git a/templates/assets/css/30-info.css b/templates/assets/css/30-info.css
index 07c94076cb..e0df8ffe2e 100644
--- a/templates/assets/css/30-info.css
+++ b/templates/assets/css/30-info.css
@@ -621,6 +621,11 @@ a.kf-more { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 28px; }
    piled up): the head or the time bold on the first line, the season or days before a time and the last entry after
    it in the value's size but quiet, a bracket of words as a small line under it, the second part as the small line
    (.kf-sub), '외' glued to the last word in grey (the whole row is the link to the place) */
+/* this .cv is a cell's value, not the render containment of css/60-motion.css (.cv: content-visibility auto, 900px
+   placeholder): on phones the cells are pills (flex), the values become blocks, and before their first paint each took
+   the 900px placeholder width — /food/ and /places/ laid out 970px wide on a 390px phone until 'load' (the page zoomed
+   out) and a page transition back to the list was aborted, 'Viewport size changed' (found on 대구각 2026-11-05) */
+.kf-main.cv, .kf-sub.cv { content-visibility: visible; }
 .rec .kf-main.cv { font-weight: 400; }
 .cv .cv-h, .cv .cv-t { font-weight: 700; color: inherit; }
 .kf-main.cv:not(.closed) .cv-h, .kf-main.cv .cv-t { color: var(--ink); }
diff --git a/tests/test_list_conditions.py b/tests/test_list_conditions.py
index 76f1ac5772..87cc839128 100644
--- a/tests/test_list_conditions.py
+++ b/tests/test_list_conditions.py
@@ -320,6 +320,19 @@ def test_in_a_browser_the_chips_combine_and_each_row_says_why(built, browser):
         ctx.close()
 
 
+def test_in_a_browser_the_list_is_the_phones_width_from_its_first_frame(built, browser):
+    """The cells' values (.kf-main.cv) are not the render containment .cv (css/60-motion.css): as phone pills they once
+    took its 900px placeholder before their first paint, and /food/ laid out 970px wide until 'load' (2026-11-06)."""
+    ctx, page, errors = _page(browser, built)
+    try:
+        ctx.add_init_script("addEventListener('pagereveal', () => { window.__w = innerWidth; })")
+        page.goto("http://site.test/food/", wait_until="load")
+        assert page.evaluate("window.__w") == 390
+        assert errors == [], errors
+    finally:
+        ctx.close()
+
+
 def test_in_a_browser_the_url_keeps_the_conditions_and_a_way_back_restores_them(built, browser):
     ctx, page, errors = _page(browser, built)
     try:
